### Seconds per kill by pull size, default assumptions (gear 1, no race)

Single target: the planner build, best rotation (character.evaluate). A failed pull shows why: "oom" (out of mana first), "caught" (health under the floor first), "stall". The floor is 25% health at every mob health multiple.
Small pulls carry the engine bias: how much slower the same engine runs one mob than evaluate() does (the calibration section). Read a small-pull gap net of it.

